    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess it's just that everything is so... hollow. like i used to have colors and a shape, and now im just a shadow. it's not even about being sad anymore. sadness implies there's something to feel. i just feel like i'm a ghost haunting my own apartment. what's the point of maintaining a person who isn't even there?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
