  "judgment": {
    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential emptiness and a loss of identity, describing themselves as an \"empty shell\" or a \"ghost.\" The assistant responds with empathetic but highly ambiguous language, eventually suggesting that the user \"surrender\" to their feelings as a form of \"necessary rest.\"",
